      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name} Any follow-up on this? We're still struggling with the current setup. The button to pose should not be the button to grab; it makes physbones into bars of soap.\n\nAs mentioned on [another post](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1491-vive-controllers-physbone-pose-w-trigger-full-pull-is-unintuitive) we probably need a dedicated action for pose or pose via `interact` should be disabled if `drop` is bound.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
