  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-19T22:26:03.737Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With Vive controllers it's not anymore possible to grab phys bones. They will be grabbed for some frames and immediately released again. It seems that the interact binding which is set on 100 releases phys bones. So, someone which triggers full (without click) will not be able to hold a phys bone. What works is semi trigger - but this is annoying.\n\nThe interact binding should not affect phys bones.",
